       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. REMIT-TIER-FEE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 INPUT-AMOUNT PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
       01 REFERENCE-RATE PIC 9(2)V9(4) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
       01 SETTLEMENT-RESULT PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN.
           IF INPUT-AMOUNT <= 120
               COMPUTE SETTLEMENT-RESULT ROUNDED = 1.89 * REFERENCE-RATE
           ELSE
               COMPUTE SETTLEMENT-RESULT ROUNDED = INPUT-AMOUNT * 0.01 * REFERENCE-RATE
           END-IF.
           GOBACK.
